{
  "type": "issue",
  "title": "FR: add `<label>` to menuSelect",
  "date": 1665914880,
  "body": "A `<select>` without a `<label>` is not very user friendly and not good from a a11y perspective.\r\nhttps://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/select\n\nPlease add a parameter to the userSelect widget, that outputs this.\n\n## CURRENT OUTPUT\n\n```\nmenuSelect({\r\n\tcontainer: '#menu-select',\r\n\tattribute: 'brand'\r\n})\n```\n\n```\n<div class=\"ais-MenuSelect\">\r\n\t<select class=\"ais-MenuSelect-select\">\r\n\t\t<option class=\"ais-MenuSelect-option\" value=\"\">See all</option>\r\n\t\t<option class=\"ais-MenuSelect-option\" value=\"Brand1\">Brand1</option>\r\n\t\t<option class=\"ais-MenuSelect-option\" value=\"Brand2\">Brand2</option>\r\n\t</select>\r\n</div>\n```\n\n## FUTURE OUTPUT 1\n\n```\nmenuSelect({\r\n\tcontainer: '#menu-select',\r\n\tattribute: 'brand',\r\n\tlabel: 'Brands'\r\n})\n```\n\n```\n<div class=\"ais-MenuSelect\">\r\n\t<label>\r\n\t\tBrands\r\n\t\t<select class=\"ais-MenuSelect-select\">\r\n\t\t\t<option class=\"ais-MenuSelect-option\" value=\"\">See all</option>\r\n\t\t\t<option class=\"ais-MenuSelect-option\" value=\"Brand1\">Brand1</option>\r\n\t\t\t<option class=\"ais-MenuSelect-option\" value=\"Brand2\">Brand2</option>\r\n\t\t</select>\r\n\t</label>\r\n</div>\n```\n\n## FUTURE OUTPUT 2\n\n```\nmenuSelect({\r\n\tcontainer: '#menu-select',\r\n\tattribute: 'brand',\r\n\tlabel: 'Brands',\r\n\tid: 'brands'\r\n})\n```\n\n```\n<div class=\"ais-MenuSelect\">\r\n\t<label for=\"brands\">Brands</label>\r\n\t<select class=\"ais-MenuSelect-select\" id=\"brands\">\r\n\t\t<option class=\"ais-MenuSelect-option\" value=\"\">See all</option>\r\n\t\t<option class=\"ais-MenuSelect-option\" value=\"Brand1\">Brand1</option>\r\n\t\t<option class=\"ais-MenuSelect-option\" value=\"Brand2\">Brand2</option>\r\n\t</select>\r\n</div>\n```\n",
